{{Wireless adapter |brand=ZyXEL |model=G-663 |revision=v1 |manuf_country=Taiwan |is_manuf=No |manuf=MitraStar |fcc_date=01/27/2006 |fcc_id=I88G663 |pcb_id=45-401-000481 |if=Mini PCI (VLYNQ) |if_bus_version=VLYNQ |chip1_brand=Texas Instruments |chip1_model=TNETW1350A |chip2_brand=Texas Instruments |chip2_model=TNETW3422 |ant_conn=U.FL |802dot11_protocols=bg |accessible_UART=Yes |oui=00:13:49 |lin_driver=[[acx100]] ? }}
"ZyXEL", "45-401-000481", and "Made in Taiwan" is silkscreened on the board in the FCC photos. {{See also|ZyXEL|MitraStar}}
Spite this device uses the same physical connector as mini PCI type III, it isn't compatible :with PCI bus. Tested in a Laptop, it didn't boot with this card connected. It uses VLYNQ bus (proprietary interface developed by [[Texas Instruments]])
==Images== <gallery> File:minipci-zyxl-G663-top.jpg|board top File:minipci-zyxl-G663-top-noshield.jpg|board top noshield File:Minipci-zyxl-G663-jp2.jpg|serial port and JTAG File:minipci-zyxl-G663-bottom.jpg|board bottom </gallery>[[Has images::internal| ]]
